REASON
doc/README.md listed Carousel among the modules whose guides were "coming next". Verifying the
module showed the consumer has to supply layout CSS the library never sets (positioned container,
viewport and slides, viewport as the container's first child), which no existing document said.
The guide covers that, every config property including which ones apply live and the touchResponse
initialize-time caveat, the methods, behaviour (hover pause, dots, swipe threshold, hidden
carousels), the generated markup, and the error messages as they now read.
